loss class values: \"Δp40\" / \"Δp63\" — certificate writes ΔP40/ΔP63; marking section says \"Δp ××\". I'll use \"Δp40\" and \"Δp63\".\n\nTemperature class: \"T30 or T50\" — as string value. Could be config axis but unclear mapping; keep type_level string.\n\nNow connection thread strings: G3/4\", G1, G1¼\". In JSON: \"G3/4\\\"\", \"G1\", \"G1¼\\\"\". I'll write \"G3/4\\\"\" with escaped quote. Or use unicode ¼: \"G1¼\\\"\". Fine.\n\nAlso note the marking: \"Q₃ ×.×\" etc — skip.\n\nLet me also record characteristics type_level \"flow_profile_sensitivity_class\": \"U0D0\" and note \"flow_conditioner\": \"No\".\n\nAlso \"reverse_flow\": \"Not designed to measure\" — string.\n\n\"installation_positions\": \"H↑ and H→ (horizontal...), V↑ (vertical...)\". I'll write value: \"H↑, H→, V↑ (horizontal with indicating device at top and at side; vertical with flow from bottom to top)\". Hmm long. Use \"H↑, H→, V↑\".\n\nEUT: \"eut_category\": \"Ultrasonic water meter\", \"eut_case\": \"B\" per OIML R49-2:2013 8.1.8. I'll include with those labels: \"eut_category_r49_2\" — keep simple: \"eut_test_category\", \"eut_test_case\".\n\nNow unit_ids: I'll leave all null except maybe °C → \"u:degree_Celsius\". Prompt says leave null unless certain. The example shows \"u:degree_Celsius\" so that one is safe. For V, m³/h, mm, MPa — I'm not fully certain of unitsdb IDs (e.g., \"u:milli_pascal\"? MPa could be \"u:megapascal\"). I'll set null for all except °C? Actually, being conservative: null everywhere, including °C? The prompt's example explicitly maps °C → \"u:degree_Celsius\", so I'll use it where °C appears. For m³ — the unitsdb id might be \"u:metric_cubic_metre\"; not certain → null.\n\nLet me now write the JSON.\n\nStructure:\n\n{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R49/2013-A-CZ1-26.03\",\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"page_total\": 9,\n    \"member_state\": \"Czech Republic\",\n    \"date_issued\": \"2026-07-20\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"Czech Metrology Institute (CMI)\",\n    \"address_lines\": [\"Okružní 31\", \"638 00 Brno\", \"Czech Republic\"],\n    \"person_responsible\": \"RNDr. Pavel Klenovský\",\n    \"person_title\": \"Director of Certification Body\"\n  },\n  \"applicants\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ADD Production\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"str. Dragomirna 36\", \"Chisinau\", \"PC: MD-2008\", \"Republic of Moldova\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manufacturers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ADD Production\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"str. Dragomirna 36\", \"Chisinau\", \"PC: MD-2008\", \"Republic of Moldova\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Water meter\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"WMP\"],\n    \"module_designation\": \"Not applicable\",\n    \"description\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": \"WMP\",\n    \"models\": [ ... 6 ... ]\n  },\n  \"components\": [...],\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"type_level\": {...},\n    \"model_level\": [...]\n  },\n  \"matrix_tables\": [...],\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"id\": \"R49\",\n    \"edition\": 2013,\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"accuracy_classes\": [2]\n  },\n  \"test_reports\": [...],\n  \"revision_history\": [...]\n}\n\nComponents — decide entries:\n1. {\"role\": \"body\", \"type_designations\": [], \"characteristics\": {\"material\": {\"value\": \"brass\"}, \"connection\": {\"value\": \"screw threads\"}}}\n2. {\"role\": \"measuring transducer\", \"type_designations\": [], \"characteristics\": {\"principle\": {\"value\": \"ultrasonic\"}, \"quantity\": {\"value\": \"one pair\"}}}\n3. {\"role\": \"electronic indicating device\", \"type_designations\": [], \"characteristics\": {\"display\": {\"value\": \"LCD\"}}}\n\nHmm, keep values simple strings. OK.\n\ntype_level characteristics (structured):\n\n- \"accuracy_class\": {\"value\": 2, \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null, \"footnote_markers\": []}\n- \"measuring_principle\": {\"value\": \"ultrasonic\", ...}\n- \"temperature_class\": {\"value